        "82a57e0b-fdb5-4a90-89b5-83287e228437": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "features",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p><strong>45mm and 30mm ceramic brush attachments - </strong>go bold with with the big brush for creating voluminous blowouts or embrace enchanting curlsusing the smaller brush.</p><p><strong>180°C / 356°F temperature - </strong>optimal temperature setting ensuring long-lasting styles, while creating no damage.</p><p><strong>Tangle-free bristles- </strong>optimal tension with zero pull!</p><p><strong>Fusion technology - </strong>brush barrel made of nano titanium ceramic, for a static-free and smooth styling. </p><p><strong>Functional design - </strong>lightweight, 360° rotating cord and a tip that stays chill.</p>",
            "page_for_content": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_aayAkC": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "how to use",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p><strong>Step 1.</strong></p><p>Attach the brush you want to work with and power it on. Let it heat up for 5 minutes.</p><p><strong>Step 2.</strong></p><p>Apply a heat-protectant of your choice and start styling your clean and dry hair.</p><p><strong>Step 3</strong>.</p><p>Starting from the top down take small sections and twist the hair around the brush creating a good grip. Run it through a couple of times to eliminate frizz and then wrap the entire section around the brush until you reach the roots. Hold it for 20 seconds and release the section.</p><p><strong>Step 4.</strong></p><p>Work your way through each layer and section until your entire hair is styled.</p><p><strong>Step 5.</strong></p><p>Optional - for extra hold, finish off with a light mist of hairspray.</p><p></p>",
            "page_for_content": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "accordion_7gVjkj": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "instructions",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<ul><li>Auto shut-off - no worrying if you left the brush on as it automatically powers down after 30 minutes.</li><li>Cool tip - the tip of the brush stays cool to the touch, preventing burns.</li><li>Allow the brush to cool completely before storing it.</li><li>Rest only on heatproof surfaces</li><li>Keep the brush away from water. Avoid using near bathtubs, showers, sinks, or any containers filled with water.</li><li>After each use, gently remove any hairs entangled in the bristles and regularly wipe down the brush with a soft, dry cloth to prevent product buildup.</li></ul><p></p>",
            "page_for_content": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        }
      },
