            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How is this different from other blowout brushes on the market?",
            "text": "<p>Think beyond the blow-dry! Unlike most blowout brushes that use hot air, limiting styling options for dry hair, our Volumewave Heated Brush excels in versatility. Traditional brushes typically come with a single brush size, restricting the range of styles you can create. Recognizing this limitation, ANSWR's founder sought a more adaptable and convenient solution. She envisioned a tool that not only enables dry use and refreshing second-day hair but also offers a variety of styling options, from blowouts to curls. The Volumewave Heated Brush fills this gap. It's designed to style dry hair effortlessly and comes with two different-sized attachments. The 45mm attachment is ideal for a voluminous, bouncy blowout, while the 30mm attachment is perfect for crafting tighter, more defined curls. It's the ultimate tool for diverse, stunning hair styles.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16155228307619__f6067e5c-800d-40b7-b7ea-bf2d64d882c2-16753409871715bdf0-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Does it work on all hair types?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! The Volumewave Heated Brush is designed to work on all hair types given that the hair is long enough to be wrapped around the brush. For fine, flat hair, it's a volume and wave wizard. And if you're battling coarse, frizzy strands, get ready for smoothness, shine, and body like never before. Also, you can switch between the two-sized brush attachments to match the style you're aiming for.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16155228307619__f6067e5c-800d-40b7-b7ea-bf2d64d882c2-16753409871715bdf0-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can it be used on wet hair?",
            "text": "<p>As a hot styling tool, the Volumewave Heated Brush should not meet wet hair to avoid heat damage. Always start with completely dry hair for the safest and most stunning results. Plus, it's your go-to for fabulous second-day hair touch-ups.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_NdbpU9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What's the correct method for using it to achieve the desired style?",
            "text": "<p>Small sections, strong grip! Start by gripping near the root and twist the brush 180°, gliding to the end of the section to beat the frizz. Do this a couple of times for each section for maximum frizz elimination. Then wrap each section around the brush up to the roots, hold for 20 seconds, then twirl the curl with your finger in the direction of the curl.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_eFFJRN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What plug options are available?",
            "text": "<p>Wherever you are, we've got you covered. The Volumewave Heated Brush comes with UK, EU, and US plug options. Shopping from the UK? We'll automatically add a UK plug at<a href=\"http://www.answr.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">www.answr.uk</a>. Internationally? Choose between EU and US plugs at <a href=\"http://www.answrbeauty.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.answrbeauty.com</a>. If your country doesn't support UK, EU, or US plugs, simply use a compatible plug adapter. Easy peasy!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
